  m_text: "1. Terms and Conditions \u2013 MoneyGain Plinko\r\n\nWelcome to MoneyGain
    Plinko! These Terms and Conditions (\u201CTerms\u201D) govern your access to
    and use of the MoneyGain Plinko mobile application (\u201CApp\u201D), which allows
    users to play games of skill and earn real rewards. By using this App, you agree
    to comply with and be bound by these Terms.\n\r\n1. Eligibility\r\n\n- The App
    is strictly intended for users who are **18 years of age or older**.  \n- By
    accessing or using the App, you confirm that you are at least 18 years old. 
    \n- If you are under 18, you must not use or access the App under any circumstances.\n\r\n2.
    No Registration Required\r\n\n- Users can play MoneyGain Plinko without registering
    or sharing personal information.  \n- The App does not require you to create
    an account or provide personal details such as your name, address, or email to
    start playing.\n\r\n3. Gameplay and Rewards\r\n\n- MoneyGain Plinko offers skill-based
    gaming experiences where users can earn real money based on their gameplay performance. 
    \n- Winnings depend solely on user interaction and game results \u2014 no outcome
    is pre-determined.  \n- Any earning or withdrawal of real money will comply with
    the App\u2019s reward policy, and users must meet eligibility requirements to
    claim cash prizes.\n\r\n4. Responsible Gaming\r\n\n- This App is intended purely
    for entertainment and skill-based gaming.  \n- Users are encouraged to play responsibly
    and avoid excessive gameplay or monetary spending.  \n- MoneyGain Plinko is not
    responsible for any financial losses incurred due to user behavior.\n\r\n5. Prohibited
    Activities\r\n\nYou agree not to:  \n- Use the App for any illegal, fraudulent,
    or unauthorized purposes.  \n- Manipulate game outcomes or attempt to hack or
    exploit the system.  \n- Use automated scripts, bots, or any unfair means to
    gain advantage.  \n- Violate any applicable laws or regulations.\n\r\n6. Payments
    and Withdrawals\r\n\n- All monetary transactions, including deposits and withdrawals,
    are processed through secure payment gateways.  \n- The App does not store or
    access users\u2019 financial information.  \n- Any withdrawal requests must comply
    with verification and minimum balance requirements (if applicable).  \n- MoneyGain
    Plinko reserves the right to withhold payments in case of fraud or suspicious
    activity.\n\r\n7. No Liability\r\n\n- MoneyGain Plinko provides the App on an
    \u201Cas is\u201D basis without warranties of any kind.  \n- We are not liable
    for any losses, damages, or issues arising from gameplay, app malfunction, or
    payment delays.  \n- Users are solely responsible for their actions while using
    the App.\n\r\n8. Updates and Modifications\r\n\n- We reserve the right to update,
    modify, or terminate any aspect of the App or these Terms at any time without
    prior notice.  \n- Continued use of the App after updates constitutes acceptance
    of the revised Terms.\n\r\n9. Governing Law\r\n\nThese Terms shall be governed
    by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes arising under
    or in connection with these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction
    of the courts located in India.\n\r\n10. Contact Us\r\n\nFor questions or concerns
    regarding these Terms, please Contact Us: support@moneygainplinko.com\r\n\n\n\xA9
    2025 MoneyGain Plinko. All Rights Reserved."
